# Grid TUI's reproducible Charm VHS proof.
Output demos/grid-tui-collaboration.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Type "go run ./cmd/grid-tui --relay http://127.0.0.1:7049 --doc vhs-demo --name VHS --color '#ff79c6'"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Alt+D
Sleep 2s
Down
Down
Enter
Sleep 2s
Alt+V
Sleep 2s
Down
Enter
Sleep 3s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
